<title>USA: WellCare Management Group Inc Q3 loss.</title>
<headline>WellCare Management Group Inc Q3 loss.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTON, N.Y. 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.05   profit	 $0.37</p>
<p> Net loss		   6,621   profit	 2,333</p>
<p> Revs			39,587		   40,112</p>
