<p> Avg shrs		   6,295		    6,242</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 includes charges of $2.9 million for additional medical expense for claims prior to October 1994; a charge of $4.4 million of notes; $466,000 in added legal costs; $1.5 million reserve for potentially uncollectible receivables; and $700,000 in adjustments to premium and other revenues.</p>
